 https://hai.stanford.edu/events/a-conversation-with-jacob-coxon-rob-reich\
 n\nThis in-person event is open to current Stanford faculty\, students\, a
 nd staff. ID will be required at check in. Other guests are invited to joi
 n the webinar.\n\nThe companies building artificial intelligence have prom
 ised to transform the world. But who gets to decide what that transformati
 on looks like and what happens when people who have worked inside those co
 mpanies question their direction? Jacob Coxon recently made a very public 
 decision to leave Anthropic\, a company that has made the responsible deve
 lopment of AI central to its identity. His departure opens a window into a
  greater debate about technological ambition\, institutional accountabilit
 y\, and the responsibilities of the companies building these increasingly 
 powerful systems. In this conversation\, Coxon will join Stanford Professo
 r Rob Reich to discuss his departure from Anthropic and the questions it r
 aises about safety\, power\, and principles in the AI industry.\n\nSpace i
 s limited\; registration is available first-come\, first served.
